### Import into Postman / VS Code REST Client. Change the host if deployed.
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get all books
GET {{host}}/books/

### 2. Get one book
GET {{host}}/books/3/

### 3. Add a book
POST {{host}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gitanjali",
  "author": "Rabindranath Tagore",
  "price": 180,
  "pages": 120
}

### 4. Update a book
PUT {{host}}/books/11/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Gitanjali (Song Offerings)",
  "author": "Rabindranath Tagore",
  "price": 210,
  "pages": 128
}

### 5. Delete a book
DELETE {{host}}/books/11/
